OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Speedway season 'couldn't
OL,4,Ahave gone better'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA first season in the Speedway
OL,7,FPremiership "could not have gone
OL,8,Fbetter", according to Northampton
OL,9,FFoxes' Rider of the Year.
OL,11,FThe team ended their inaugural season
OL,12,Fby beating Kings Lynn on its home track
OL,13,Fat Northampton International Shaleway
OL,14,Fnear Brafield-on-the-Green.
OL,16,FThe newly formed Foxes finished bottom
OL,17,Fof the league table but still
OL,18,Fregistered five wins.
