OL,3,GNEWSAFirst Speedway season 'couldn't
OL,4,Ahave gone better'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKye Thomson, who was the team's Rider
OL,7,Fof the Year, said: "Northampton [Foxes]
OL,8,Fhave given me my opportunity for my
OL,9,Ffirst full season in the Premiership. I
OL,10,Fcould not [have] asked for it to go any
OL,11,Fbetter."
